  "description": "A Quick Sight dashboard must query the underlying database when viewers open or interact with it, rather than rely on a periodically refreshed imported copy. Which dataset mode should the architect select?",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>문제 풀이</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 106</p><h1>문제 풀이</h1></div><strong>106 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"106번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:98%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q106\" data-question=\"Q106\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q106</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A Quick Sight dashboard must query the underlying database when viewers open or interact with it, rather than rely on a periodically refreshed imported copy. Which dataset mode should the architect select?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q106\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">SPICE</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q106\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q106\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Direct Query</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q106\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Backup</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">Direct Query</a>는 대시보드를 사용할 때 원본 데이터 소스를 조회한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">SPICE</a>는 가져온 데이터의 새로 고침이 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">QuickSight / Quick Sight</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"문제 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q105/\">이전 문제 <b>Q105</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q107/\">다음 문제 <b>Q107</b></a></span></nav><p class=\"save-note\">선택과 채점 결과는 이 브라우저에 자동 저장됩니다.</p></section>"
}
